{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1376,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2d62f0fa1840953b8889e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "扣子太多的衣服我有点……\r\n因为我很冒失嘛，\r\n就很常会扣错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b58fb3d4235f3f40c918ad7765fbf5de4e858315255944b1eec1a92e55e756b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aaf1b4596273375fc86616c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要唱节奏很快的歌的时候，\r\n不觉得会很紧张吗……？\r\n……好、好像会吃螺丝的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e7e1d7ef53467f5876687e33da3d3f1f8550d2887e151d4398d4bb240ba4d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f14e7df933f42e2b431b906b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有这个包包，\r\n就会有一百倍的勇气～\r\n要是……实力也能多一百倍就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0be6e2f327b97a25d6161a4c6d0a9da0c96798e9c86e8b55844863cddf4d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cf7f98f1540434eb106e945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包包和胸前的蝴蝶结很可爱，\r\n是我最喜欢的部份哦～\r\n光是戴在身上就能获得鼓励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cb3c5512a2f04631ebccf94b5130de0529c7712f0efb2f2d3b93db91034045c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdeaf9988da0b6a55e36fd8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还想说包包怎么这么重……\r\n结果里面装的不是课本，\r\n是我的闹钟～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd8f9583798ca9b75553b954905355ef2edff1d1d3dfc1ac6c82db485c4cb84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce2fcb4625a8f76daa53470",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贩卖部的胡萝卜面包……\r\n我虽然想吃吃看，\r\n但要比动作快的话，我好像不行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9931fc6d407bfbe6f85cd1236eb768fa5caf39ba9d907836b0c32976b265381",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75bd702b4a5ca2fe27000be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上走在路上是很危险的……\r\n很容易撞到或是跌倒，\r\n走到宿舍的时候都已经累翻了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "567230f1bb07cda5862c77ce7b74b72f8050b788410e0831f6de867517c8c20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9342242f66ea99d708552d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花是很危险的……\r\n走路的时候不小心看太入迷，\r\n撞到柱子肿了好大一包呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea4a4f5953651093010e90a5f6550d51c2370029f1687bc7c86d532ac2ac9700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67577281d5c0817bd7005026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海边是很危险的……\r\n会被生气的螃蟹先生夹手指，\r\n游泳圈还会被浪卷走……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a567af1468c255e25aa87fdf7f0bf4aef5c96479e4245b96df4a8e82cce3ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ca6900899dfd4b14eb8a002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烤、烤地瓜是很危险的～！\r\n不仔细吹凉的话，\r\n就会像我一样烫到舌头……呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "038a4b4188e17819ac8a2bdca76b9b95bd9b04068b6995f8e258018472308b9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805f6ca3af30d3be58a98f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪……虽然很漂亮，但也很危险。\r\n我常常在下坡的时候滑倒……\r\n滚得变成像雪球一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "999c9e88e57a69f42d07d8c7b9776ebe33851ed6355ae66c725b07f5d1accf88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23aaf72c6f5b7c3aba4330bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我舍不得吃糖果，就一直盯着看……\r\n结果脑中浮现出身为宝石商人的\r\n爸爸的脸喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa343a7fdabf783cfca3101a53d1210e68e588a0b506c6276d6822b2a6591bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157584d407f96cff1f7d49a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "数码一天会倒下好几次再爬起来……\r\n我想她一定是累了吧。\r\n送慰劳品给她，会给她造成麻烦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2094a34852457bbce20da04ebdfb42ee0d265c2bb16af879bb7089d1d51db7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28057cbce752c81b361fe77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风好像都不会咬我。\r\n她说我哭得太夸张很无聊……\r\n这让我感到有点寂寞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd10d7dd536e83134aad41fcd3c1ef1829f1c60b3c45f7ba08408a65b1cff95e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072ba0544296a3b0f2d699bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔、喔耶～～！耶～～！\r\n我我、我做对了吗？这是太阳教我的\r\n派对玩咖招呼法……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00744a9a570bd681800501b02ed9761f3a1bd5dca4d27b31eab49d2a28de3c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c4a6d6c3c211e63b3d31bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信连听我唱演歌时，\r\n都会表现得很兴奋……嘿嘿。\r\n希望还能跟她一起去唱卡拉OK……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb3c619371d40b7ea1c247216ae858e2c876f5e2f1eaa37951480b1c05d1e3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5340e6008f4108b8b7a543b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的占卜说，\r\n我的幸运物是南瓜……耶嘿嘿。\r\n或、或许，会遇到好事喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e1796831f48dbdf218e7145cb93dc69aa77ed006c9e1644f2f43b34592828e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82e0acbc990b63a9a322d22f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点、点心时间，我和乌拉拉\r\n会各自带点心来聚会。\r\n今天要带什么好呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd55db81c51df4387ef701bd9708d98c614ac7cb15b20d0cbacfe935547bb340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f0abf1ead44c923c6bb0f78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一到晚上，\r\n就会有猫跑来找我玩。\r\n是因为喜欢这件衣服吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9e391123126f0b28934ea2fb699f44584786c0b8b47110f0cd5d724dab219c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee27d25226ef290f1b574d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……我真是个糟糕的前辈！\r\n我悄～悄地向迷路的新生搭话后，\r\n对方就被我吓哭了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae126bb7067c95960f0f41e002d023ebbb84a246be37dfdf6c576cc6f4a878b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f07ae8d4dab6d7f7406a829",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……请、请问……你有水吗？\r\n我戴着南瓜打瞌睡后，\r\n流了一身汗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f12f533ce9d70e1dab6dfcb1643f8ec0a643b79b458dfd14a7611179173d823",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9465af6c0a7904ab43ddaa5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我……一定很难吃的。\r\n可是，大家只要一看见我，\r\n就会说「肚子饿了」……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38f5a21e680f74da848c4867265e5d1e1edb1267d5b605bb7f11b074024f9bd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d01e9c91d2893906ef74774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不、不介意的话，请过来这里……\r\n灯笼很暖和喔。\r\n怎么样……我有帮上忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c3f0fa884408884e6842a6a19a639964b43ba20c3ad85fd5d9dff2c4f8ce62c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d424103807878a730c5f66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴上南瓜后，\r\n感觉自己就像是换了一个人。\r\n变成比平常、强大一点的我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f9299bb6920151373ac1625d05204c2a2a57dc9b2253107607b1e3d66ea55d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091bf818ec504c955f2bb999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我外出时，不知为何总是会被\r\n乌鸦盯上……唔哇！？\r\n怎么有这么多南瓜碎屑啊～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f965277e9b066af0dacd6a4ad9df859855d3015904fb9258759d492e1763793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e1423c46a27bddc53ac0e14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今、今天的训练也拜偷你了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a97edd4914dd61ad637cf09bcf56264e0bf8c2ac9dc0c9742fbf08f49af18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf0d0d044073cb948b3bbe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よ、よーし",
      "source_fingerprint": "527fd1e7be31d241dade9d8affb95505bbfbca7ba717b63d1777774c35574e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:386738123d75582d3e92e2f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做什么训练呢……？\r\n因为我自己选不出来……\r\n你能帮我做决定的话就太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27268cbf19458070a8363c4cde2a17a2f662f08acd35ce12d031a1b94d5bef7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4ee1453fe5318f5cbec078",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很、很抱歉我来晚了……！\r\n我总算是做完准备工作了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "277218a2f014b44ee57242c26f31b9fc45baa3e6408224eb280faf4257871aa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e494dd7e637eac091bf2d35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习的时候，\r\n我会小心不要出状况的……\r\n所以，能麻烦你指导我做吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a736321c9abd0686828f9fe07015c898566fcaeed983650bed76ef150bbbc426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a75746ce5c6aa7adf9d5279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算只是一点点……\r\n只要继续向前进就会改变的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f211f5516d4c035ca735fa8941020476b5ec8e026d08033cc23b38fcf281f622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c895d568e6133b0288fe59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是为了没有抛弃我的训练员……\r\n我也要有更多的成长才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93780161fd095795d45486f1daafc6432ae8ef99bc87e197054fe2ec2696e9d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709a42886b69944d0146ac5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想说能在训练的时候，\r\n让你看到不一样的我……！\r\n应该多少……稍微有点改变吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "175dde2059ad3b1d61af80804f424938713e3303b25e7be6d951e2b5b9c75f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6194b80c5586e40a9c0d0a67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕、毕竟是集训嘛，\r\n所以……\r\n就希望可以做到确实的锻炼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7539ca71466e61c8f7ae55f4ffa17dd39393b419bac116a227ad0544255e5af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:518f786211147fc6fcfb7472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么训练项目，我都能完成！\r\n因、因为我知道训练员指示的道路，\r\n是正确的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d986d117eac335b65bdbac23d6e351fea09b29d3664eaad79931f4830cec79c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68319d87bdf979c0a1db436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为、为了避免发生坏事，\r\n用衣服的力量把厄运赶捧……！？\r\n呜哇～咬到舌抖了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19db5d82234cdabada459131d1bfc0cb21f23f4b71f6b984dcced65e44654e93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e423bfc0c62f288fbbf5e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呃……我、我没事。\r\n我只是稍微把脖子上的缎带绑紧，\r\n让它不会松掉而已……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c93213b54444cb9db182a917d91585363dbb2b212cbf4384b31ea7442e7d2f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00cf748900ebf989c26874bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，今天的我跟平时不太一样喔。\r\n这双高跟鞋很好穿，\r\n我目前只有跌倒一次而已……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ea717f1f01ae57defd707e24a3d8bba545a3240d241e2e9820500ddb459cf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f982761f90062850e9c818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为理想的自己，\r\n是一件困难的事情呢……\r\n但是，我不想放弃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c085b818ebaa45326df3c3b12a601a87c1b4be1fc6b9c37521f40eecf8f2d901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:325e22e9c8c0f4bc8c3bcb2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有想去的地方，\r\n请跟我说喔……！\r\n我我、我会努力帮忙带路的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc1284c5e7b0e3033b89429b5035f1dafe6756f2d57479ac525d95aa25076da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bec020ed4a8f2081a2c233c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训、训练员是我的救赎……\r\n也是我的路标──\r\n我打从心底信任着你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d9cd9a616c46cdfb9c70f5dfb8c3a51a32eff10daa2d124b374adad46128075",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22dbe89d8d286b25e55992d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏训练员的关系……\r\n让我能带着自信活下去了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d90d3f22d3ccc98b458da93707334dd859d7d97cd6de23696f8c74dbc78f5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeab614601f2278f6f8b370e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来这样的我……\r\n也还是有救的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6cdcb25da089b269d0d6a301c213640ea69f5ad7ff91100df6a405898d7bf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95c9ee790ecf2753e689208",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你所为我指示的未来……\r\n希望今后也能跟你一起向前迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a5b75c37d02ef80fbe7148fda05948f4af9e57ee14b06788aff55cbab3d9fdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9975e6473b243dd5169c425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有迷路就抵达终点了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7edfc73b6f6a4d3cb7738085b054a0631bb732ac49e016fe5131c2a3c4709ea8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e504ea8eb0bff7c3bd9961",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我应该也稍微有了些成长……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b5ce7feb58b789e8d18f492591e0c311a186a4ffd3ea80a182d1b7133a40f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219cb8ada3e129d2a38b35cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……！\r\n竟然会有这样的转变……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea42867937c764f618163d13fb3d46cf57cde174a9724297f0f52c3982558a15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a90cf437ead3d566fc382768",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哇哇……！\r\n我是名将怒涛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab0fa0f93b071f6cd387ad09f7d7e4602ec4d897ea4d15c7331cbdc2524bccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2dd96adb1ee5b165c601132",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是怒、怒怒怒怒怒怒涛！\r\n梦想是──咦？没时间了……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "71f2368515841f02d651a55c7c419050b465f33ae5eab38e2277987c267e5ae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4376622a64d75213dcdf8d29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽、虽然我不知道自己帮不帮得上忙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "facaddee1cdc0d4a5ac2cf65abd6e497f6636cc0c4b9c730a7cd2a363c12210a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c828001e10fe9b178106e63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我也能帮得上忙的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c866511458381222fc1b50ab468fe2b6398ff3c8d793af24c191546f60c3cdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a27960f3f8d97996da9b31f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……就像心里的火被点燃了一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b9a616c19ea8b2c777cf44ba39b5afc7af6970fd4561775adea6e03f36882cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4fdc4be3d6980e1ffdfbc88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你、你愿意引导我这种人啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9546e88eae9e689643f8a4e2d22dd63c0c20267d9b6e00d0a210b4129bc94f34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c525e16c5ba8a9fb214b792d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是灵魂的领路人……\r\n咦，这里是哪里～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7cee369abcc8135990246c693f9ee01c41f4c009d9379a1c1ed7bfd57d8637",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0091d2fbc9851ad084770c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是名将怒涛。\r\n我相信总有一天能够抵达……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50b455016010e341a5af48c70db0ac36fa480dfb257ce8cfe2e61a45f09b2448",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb3c6d6a63665e9abaa89d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家！上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f5f38d362f010c0be22f5a894d96125ef02c61224eaf0c14a876369cdd855b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4027bf4c08be6600a358c4e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首席训练员最近身体还好吗……\r\n……现在的话，稍微有点理解\r\n当初她选择你的原因了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40cbf54888442c833dd8fef2d72c1bb7b236d0669385e587a147522fa459acbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb813ac7727965b55b2cd74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b05a4da42798311a08966c40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7180c84251fc17e31fa052f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是世界上的男人都像你这样的话，\r\n我的性格也能会变得更好吧……？\r\n……算了算了，就当我没说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac5b13fca4bf9981a9115a6baa4dde27c2de52d44250140428bd6d0a1ebe4b5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c21bcd6d13c39ea1466efaa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近画『蔬菜少女☆萝卜子』也越来越顺手了……\r\n我、我又没说要给拿你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "311d78dd0c15d96a69c3144ac27ee0f6294be74e60099307353f91248d5b8a6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98183380daf31dfea0cf96c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐啊。\r\n有言在先，我可不会找你要压岁钱什么的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b756c829dae9d634e14090f270e606009e40f011f6329d4647e5c052c1cfc73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9fb3307484d69d0f48dbaa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节又怎么了？\r\n别期待我会做什么啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1fec1f09470fcdef4baca46e77349b73e075896e52bef6c3aceae06ff8f0cab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7645ba878892132e92a8f150",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力……你拿着吧。\r\n姑且也算是受了你的照顾……\r\n就当是我的谢礼了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c446d227afa0c3331047cd99476559d4d71cec040d707c9e835496b26aead37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43689b43e3751760cc70acb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向星星许愿……吗。\r\n希望我以后能变得不那么怕生……\r\n哈？！你、你听见了吗？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88cf8bcf89bafc50c24cf2c6b0e6e5d765af27f0b25344528a571d18a68dd07f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92bb2214173727921b0d68bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变装的话自然会戴面具，\r\n就算被人看见了也认不出来吧……\r\n有没有南瓜头面具什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f66cc238f0660d299ec69e2826c27c24dec644e5600d5108b765a4c2df530499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1308aa4c96f3ecc68f8df36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞晚会上，\r\n大家都要盛装打扮之后一起跳舞呢。\r\n……我悄悄待在角落里就行啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fbe7e96da90c153eaf32e7928853b76ebda0d4ef2dc6585e16538e21f5aa5dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d9e5f5d0738927ca62000c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去买礼物的时候，有位店员一直盯着我看……\r\n……那应该是在感谢我吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf30fd830012212f1426ad5853b0ad225ec203d7090f795fe0b575039baa9d69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7a58da73a44f997f25e9e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了，做到啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62859bdfa7ae3f8bf7cced0d6685d8077774b6d8991db0484ed6942b00db7e1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7be8629603ae45ce0445be99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家经常年末时来目白家聚会……\r\n但是……\r\n我果然不大擅长应付这样热闹的局面啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d29526cebe249cb895ea99288f9c0e7142c5789635d17836364cb536f64564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053f43208bc4df336e9cd476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你今天过生日对吧。\r\n……那个……生、生日快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9df896f690513cbc7bada7f2c0de0509f93b5c2c68bfb878f677b53dc6c5e3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9a6abe925715bfe2415bfb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你准备了礼物……来，给你。\r\n……别在这儿就拆开啊！\r\n等你一个人的时候再打开看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b319582ffde58dd5e7da89b0ee9e90f037be0448826d524437c2cf17f99784ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f9f7797f75614eea1a5570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很高兴大家愿意为我庆祝生日，\r\n但我就变成『寿星』而受人关注的话……\r\n还是会有些紧张的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecbb1d3afa1b96554b50c588cbb7e8c521629967ebd01d03d326d42de501865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20cbf958e7e012e4c0e18bbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然今天确实是我的生日啦……\r\n你倒也不用特意来祝贺我的……\r\n……但是……呃……谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b52ff525db8fbdd3554733a718c1c1d594598e25d538e530a45ccc5332addd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039d6ba5fa3d1789bbfae3c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告啊。\r\n……是什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b523cc33f6ae394d8d5ff829490247c56e9bde3c7599fab731c8e25e962dcad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753278159454982bdbabdf7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了哦。\r\n有人愿意牵挂你，真是幸福啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72e93a3de03b0ae3ba814312ac707df944619db89e55d62a2776664dfc5c7a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad181b65c9589bc8de2192ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了。\r\n……我也不会输的、",
      "source_fingerprint": "8461348af8eae25834338c126b03f7c13457bb2cc796cf20dc0a02931c1bc13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed7745f9dee199e52cf7432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像最近又有什么活动要开始了，\r\n稍微有些在意呢。\r\n……我也能鼓起勇气参加吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd2a37626a723b42dac84db5c6538d111bb076f28e5f70e1e6a4e29f10626dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3cc2f106d6c3af9f2c4275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……怪不得最近这么热闹，\r\n原来是在举行活动啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f381aef4e0e7358e50c943f32dd7b7a91765c39d825454b96bb73026e817318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22cf4544029497f0242106f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我能更……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee541f7d10f27fbb5b43ddec4f25a0665e36bc7a5ed429dc23f3081a0836124",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "1002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
